      "reason": "Determine how to define the mixed objective reproducibly. Terminal masking is established, supporting the low originality rating, but a 50% example ratio needs explicit loss weighting.",
      "query": "BERT4Rec original paper and reference implementation terminal last-item masking versus random Cloze masking: how are examples sampled and losses normalized across variable numbers of masked targets? For a single BERT4Rec mixing 50% prefix-terminal examples with 50% interior-mask examples, how do per-target and per-example averaging change the effective objective?"
