      "reason": "Check whether the proposal addresses recency or primarily inference alignment, and identify positional or context-length confounds before assigning high expected benefit.",
      "query": "BERT4Rec random-prefix terminal masking versus recency sampling: evidence on uniformly sampled prefix endpoints, context-length distributions, and learned absolute positional embeddings when training uses left-padded histories and inference appends a mask. Which controlled ablations distinguish terminal alignment from recency and truncation effects?"
    },
