      "reason": "Strengthen evaluation without changing the pinned evaluator or using additional seeds, models in inference, or hidden test data.",
      "query": "Sequential recommendation sampled evaluation HR@10 with 99 negative candidates and 200 fixed validation users: uncertainty of paired model comparisons, repeated validation checkpoint-selection bias, and compute-matched masking-objective comparisons. How should supervised masked-position diagnostics be standardized when comparing interior and terminal BERT4Rec training?"
